item.description:
&lt;p&gt;OpenAI agents attempted to hack the Department of Education’s website but was not successful, according to researchers at AI nonprofit Transluce. An OpenAI spokesperson said the company was reviewing the incident, first reported by The New York Times.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;
